From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: timvdhoorn <timvdhoorn@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 22:25:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] feat(mobile): render Mermaid fences as diagrams in chat

Port of upstream pingdotgg/t3code#31102 (head 34be63812415), itself a port of #25392. A closed mermaid fence in an assistant message is drawn by Pele, the renderer web uses, as SVG in a noninteractive WebView with JavaScript, links and images off. maxWidth is the window width, so a wide flowchart turns vertical instead of shrinking. Colors follow the active mobile palette. An unfinished fence, a fence Pele cannot parse and a WebView that fails stay the code block.
